{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_016","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"{\n\"TransactionType\" : \"TrustSet\" ,\n\"Account\" : \"ra5nK24KXen9AHvsdFTKHSANinZseWnPcX\" ,\n\"Fee\" : \"12\" ,\n\"Flags\" : 262144 ,\n\"LastLedgerSequence\" : 8007750 ,\n\"LimitAmount\" : {\n\"currency\" : \"USD\" ,\n\"issuer\" : \"rsP3mgGb2tcYUrxiLFiHJiQXhsziegtwBc\" ,\n\"value\" : \"100\"\n},\n\"Sequence\" : 12\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 229","char_start":4701,"char_end":4979,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_017","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"In addition to the common fields , TrustSet transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 232","char_start":5025,"char_end":5107,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_018","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Description","location_hint":"paragraph 233","char_start":5111,"char_end":5152,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_019","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"LimitAmount Object Amount Object defining the trust line to create or modify, in the format of a Currency Amount .","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":5156,"char_end":5270,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_020","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"LimitAmount . currency String (Amount.currency) The currency to this trust line applies to, as a three-letter ISO 4217 Currency Code or a 160-bit hex value according to currency format . \"XRP\" is invalid.","location_hint":"paragraph 235","char_start":5272,"char_end":5476,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_021","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"LimitAmount . value String (Amount.value) Quoted decimal representation of the limit to set on this trust line.","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5478,"char_end":5589,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_022","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"LimitAmount . issuer String (Amount.issuer) The address of the account to extend trust to.","location_hint":"paragraph 237","char_start":5591,"char_end":5681,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_023","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"QualityIn Number UInt32 (Optional) Value incoming balances on this trust line at the ratio of this number per 1,000,000,000 units. A value of 0 is shorthand for treating balances at face value. For example, if you set the value to 10,000,000, 1% of incoming funds remain with the sender. If an account sends 100 currency, the sender retains 1 currency unit and the destination receives 99 units. This option is included for parity: in practice, you are much more likely to set a QualityOut value. Note that this fee is separate and independent from token transfer fees.","location_hint":"paragraph 238","char_start":5683,"char_end":6252,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_024","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"QualityOut Number UInt32 (Optional) Value outgoing balances on this trust line at the ratio of this number per 1,000,000,000 units. A value of 0 is shorthand for treating balances at face value. For example, if you set the value to 10,000,000, 1% of outgoing funds would remain with the issuer. If the sender sends 100 currency units, the issuer retains 1 currency unit and the destination receives 99 units. Note that this fee is separate and independent from token transfer fees.","location_hint":"paragraph 239","char_start":6254,"char_end":6735,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_025","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"If the account specified in LimitAmount.issuer is blocking incoming trust lines, the transaction fails with the result code tecNO_PERMISSION .","location_hint":"paragraph 240","char_start":6739,"char_end":6881,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_026","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"Requires the DisallowIncoming amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 241","char_start":6883,"char_end":6935,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_027","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"Transactions of the TrustSet type support additional values in the Flags field , as follows:","location_hint":"paragraph 243","char_start":6953,"char_end":7045,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_028","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"Flag Name Hex Value Decimal Value Description","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":7049,"char_end":7094,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_029","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"tfSetfAuth 0x00010000 65536 Authorize the other party to hold currency issued by this account . (No effect unless using the asfRequireAuth AccountSet flag .) Cannot be unset.","location_hint":"paragraph 245","char_start":7098,"char_end":7272,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_030","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"tfSetNoRipple 0x00020000 131072 Enable the No Ripple flag, which blocks rippling between two trust lines of the same currency if this flag is enabled on both.","location_hint":"paragraph 246","char_start":7274,"char_end":7432,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_031","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"tfClearNoRipple 0x00040000 262144 Disable the No Ripple flag, allowing rippling on this trust line.","location_hint":"paragraph 247","char_start":7434,"char_end":7533,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_032","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"tfSetFreeze 0x00100000 1048576 Freeze the trust line.","location_hint":"paragraph 248","char_start":7535,"char_end":7588,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_033","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"tfClearFreeze 0x00200000 2097152 Unfreeze the trust line.","location_hint":"paragraph 249","char_start":7590,"char_end":7647,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_034","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"tfSetDeepFreeze 0x00400000 4194304 Deep Freeze the trust line.","location_hint":"paragraph 250","char_start":7649,"char_end":7711,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_035","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"tfClearDeepFreeze 0x00800000 8388608 Clear the Deep Freeze on the trust line.","location_hint":"paragraph 251","char_start":7713,"char_end":7790,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_036","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"If a transaction tries to enable No Ripple but cannot, it fails with the result code tecNO_PERMISSION . Before the fix1578 amendment became enabled, such a transaction would result in tesSUCCESS (making any other changes it could) instead.","location_hint":"paragraph 252","char_start":7794,"char_end":8033,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e98d1069b3a8_037","source_id":"src_e98d1069b3a8","source_hash":"3cad1847189463e23d55d4d98f47e2cd35740ab04033d140add4ffbf19f1cd4a","text":"The Auth flag of a trust line does not determine whether the trust line counts towards its owner&#x27;s XRP reserve requirement. An issuer can pre-authorize a trust line with the tfSetfAuth flag only, even if the limit and balance of the trust line are 0.","location_hint":"paragraph 253","char_start":8035,"char_end":8290,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T19:36:19.245Z"}
